          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya mfalume kuocha chira chitabu ambacho Baruku wachiandika kpwa maneno ga Jeremia, Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Jeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hala chitabu chanjina uchiandike ujumbe wosi ambao kala u kpwenye chitabu cha kpwandza chirichoochwa ni Jehoyakimu mfalume wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha muambire Jehoyakimu mfalume wa Juda, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Uwe wachiocha cho chitabu na uchiamba, “Kpwa utu wani waandika mo chitabuni kukala ati mfalume wa Babeli ni lazima edze abanange tsi ihi na kuaolaga atu na nyama osi ariomumu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo kuhusu Jehoyakimu mfalume wa Juda, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Kandakala na mutu wa chivyaziche wa kusagarira chihi cha utawala cha Daudi. Lufure rindatsuphiwa kondze riphye na dzuwa mutsi na usiku rindalwamiswa ni manena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindamtiya adabu iye, anae na atumishie kpwa uyi wao. Nindaahenda aho na nyo atu asagalao Jerusalemu na a Juda aphahwe ni chila aina ya uyi nriogomba nindaahenda, mana taayasikira bii.” ’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
